title: metarecord-list:apply
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord list: apply a zone's content

Runs what a field of the [[metarecord-list panel]] holds — `finder`, `simplified`, `normal` or `columns` — and leaves the field, so that the panel's keys work again. A final `stay` keeps the focus in it; a focus held elsewhere is never taken away.
